        },
        "content_ywwKwB": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Absolutely! The Qure Micro-Infusion System is designed to be <strong>gentle and effective for all skin types</strong>, including <strong>sensitive skin.<br/><br/></strong></p><p>We know that everyone's skin is unique, and that's why our device is crafted to minimize irritation while maximizing results. The 24k gold plated micro-needles are designed to be virtually painless, and our serums are formulated to soothe and nourish even the most delicate skin.<br/><br/>So, if you have sensitive skin, you can confidently use our micro-infusion system to achieve a healthier, more radiant complexion.</p>",
